OL,4,CNo sign of missing men after fishing   
OL,5,Cboat Kilda recovered near Orkney       
OL,6,GPolice say there is no trace of two    
OL,7,Gmissing men after a fishing boat that  
OL,8,Gwent missing near the Isle of Lewis a  
OL,9,Gmonth ago was recovered near Orkney.   
OL,11,FThree men were on board the Kilda when 
OL,12,Fit disappeared on 13 October.          
OL,14,FThe body of crew member Douglas        
OL,15,FCraigie was found by search teams the  
OL,16,Ffollowing day but two other men -      
OL,17,FNorman Murray and Murdo Morrison - are 
OL,18,Fstill missing.                         
